{"id":"630376","name":"韭菜馅饼","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/630376/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"高筋粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"200g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3枚"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉加盐温水。","img":"images/630376/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"揉成面团静置三小时以上（我放了一宿）。","img":"images/630376/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅热倒油。","img":"images/630376/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋打散倒入热油锅中。","img":"images/630376/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"筷子不停画圈。","img":"images/630376/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"这样蛋碎均匀了。","img":"images/630376/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"韭菜洗净切碎到店香油拌匀。","img":"images/630376/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加鸡蛋碎。","img":"images/630376/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀均匀面皮","img":"images/630376/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"保成包子状，轻轻压扁。","img":"images/630376/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"入油锅煎至金黄色翻面","img":"images/630376/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"两面金黄即可。","img":"images/630376/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/630376/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"鲜美一餐。","img":"images/630376/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"一起吃韭菜馅饼吧！","img":"images/630376/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"馅料里面还可以加一些虾皮，味道会更加鲜美。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}